WEBVTT

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.210
Welcome home, Master

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.330
Welcome home, Mistress

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.330
Welcome home, Master

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:27.290
Welcome home, Mistress

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.330
Welcome home, Master

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.540
Omelet fully loaded with chicken and rice

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.420
Make it yummy, moe moe kyun

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.790
With plenty of milk and plenty of love

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:41.630
Let's cast a spell, moe moe kyun

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:48.880
Seeing sooo many masters here makes me so happy, oink!

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.330
Fresh out of Moe Moe Forest

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:51.960
This maid's going whole hog, oink!

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.330
Welcome home, Master

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:56.380
Kawaii is justice, oink!

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:59.420
My makeup's just the bomb, like, O.M.G.!

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:02.960
Ramen, extra veggies, topped with sauce, fat, and garlic aplenty

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.170
Welcome home to the pigsty!

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:09.080
Hey! (Yeah!) This is my maid way! (Whoo!)

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:11.830
Shot through your heart like, Boom! Boom! Boom! (Alright!)

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:13.790
Take an instax with the scumbag

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:16.250
Hey! (Yeah!) Maid princesses from Hell! (Whoo!)

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:18.880
Stan for me or, Blam! Blam! Blam! (Okay)

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:20.920
Petticoats whirl in a scuffle

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:22.670
Hide-and-seek at the maid cafe

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:24.380
Nice service for booming sales

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:26.170
Falling in love is a big no-no

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:28.500
A cutesy garden of secrets

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:33.750
With the return of Crimson Supernova Manami,

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:37.630
Maidalien plans to raid Oinky Doink Cafe.

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:41.540
However, an internal leak drags
the police into the picture,

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:45.670
and an enraged Manami tracks down
the traitor who squealed.

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:48.500
This is none other than Nerula,

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:51.330
who swore an oath of sisterhood
with a maid from Oinky Doink.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:57.880
Manami executes Nerula,
who dies in the arms of her sister.

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:02.880
<b>Creature Gang War Chronicles:</b>

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:02.880
<b>The Bloody Extra-Akiba Terrestrial Showdown!</b>

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:14.750
A week from the gun down of an Akiba maid,

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:18.580
a maid who claims to be responsible for the killing has
turned herself in to Akihabara Police Station.

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:22.380
The suspect is the manager of the cafe where the victim worked,

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:24.750
<b>Maid</b>

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:24.750
<b>Gunned Down</b>

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:24.750
<b>ARRESTED: On Suspicion of Murder</b>

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:24.750
<b>Manager of Invader Cafe Destron</b>

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:24.750
and according to Akihabara police,

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:28.580
she is repeating nonsense such as
"The cosmos vanished from the victim,"

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:31.710
<b>Maid</b>

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:31.710
<b>Gunned Down</b>

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:31.710
<b>Suspect Repeating Nonsense</b>

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:31.710
<b>Investigation With Possible Psychiatric Evaluation</b>

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:31.710
and the police continue their investigation
with the possibility of a psychiatric evaluation.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.750
It's already been a week, huh?

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:37.290
When Ranko brought Nagomi back
all covered in blood,

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:38.710
it was quite a shock, wasn't it?

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:42.000
I'm surprised the Maidalien people
backed off so easily.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.000
Why?

00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:44.420
I don't know.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:47.210
However, it seems certain that
they plan on attacking us.

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:49.170
We'll work on keeping watch again today.

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:52.330
You figure Nagomi's not coming back?

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:53.790
I hope she's okay.

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:58.290
Hey everyone, if anyone asks,
Nagomi's out sick again today, got it?

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:02.000
Ranko, you okay?

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:05.290
I shall focus on my duties is all.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:10.420
Now that we have you back, Miss Manami,

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:13.210
we swear we're with you all the way to the end.

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:14.330
That's right!

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:15.580
To the ends of outer space!

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:18.540
There are less of us now,
but the ones left are all ready to go.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:22.790
The wussy ones'll come 'round
once we smash up that pigsty.

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:24.710
I don't know about that.

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:26.210
Hot!

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:27.420
Ugaki!

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:30.420
Yer the one who went n' let Maidalien
get all soft, remember?

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:33.500
I just did what the previous head told me to do!

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:37.210
Our previous head changed after you got locked up.

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:39.420
She realized money's more important
than brute strength.

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:40.830
Don'tcha lie to me!

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:45.420
The head I knew would've never put up with
Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam gettin' crushed!

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.330
That's hot!

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.040
I tell you it's true!

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:52.920
What's real t' me is different from yer truth.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.790
Please forpig me.

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.920
Oh, that's all right.

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:06.460
Looking for a rom-ham-tic time?

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:08.790
Come to Oinky Doink Cafe.

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:10.790
Looking for a rom-ham-tic time?

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:12.920
Come to Oinky Doink Cafe.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:23.960
Hey there, I'm a ninja.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:27.710
Good sirs, come get a discount coupon.

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:30.750
Nagomi...

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.000
My name...

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:35.210
is not Nagomi.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.210
A humble cup of tea, my good lady! Nin nin!

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.420
I know of a maid by the name of Nagomi.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:47.170
She is missing and we are very worried.

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:50.170
I'm sure she's living happily somewhere.

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:53.960
I'm sure this Nagomi you speak of
just wasn't cut out to be a maid.

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:59.080
I wonder why Nagomi wanted to
be a maid in the first place?

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:03.750
W-well, probably because maids are so cute, maybe?

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:06.500
Then do you suppose she's disillusioned now?

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:08.420
No, that's not it!

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:12.380
I'm sure she's just disappointed in herself.

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:15.580
What do ninjas do?

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:20.540
Well, we throw kunai and ninja stars and smoke bombs.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.330
Oh, and fling around poi.

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:24.170
And is that fun?

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:27.130
It is! Ninjas are the best!

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:29.630
As long as you do your ninjutsu training
and stay stealthy it's safe,

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:33.250
unlike maids who engage in shootouts with weapons...

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:36.250
Really, being a ninja is so much fun...

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.500
So fun...

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:43.670
Of course this isn't fun!

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:47.670
I... a ninja isn't what I really want to be!

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:50.130
But it's no use anymore.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:53.080
Even at the most crucial moment
all I did was rely on someone else,

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.040
and I couldn't do anything.

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:57.710
That's why Nerula...

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:02.830
I don't want to see anyone else die
just because I'm useless.

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:06.290
That's why I can't be a maid anymore!

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:16.380
But that's precisely why I want you
to stay a maid, Nagomi.

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:20.420
I don't understand what you mean at all, Ranko.

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.130
Right...

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:28.250
Anyway, as I'm but a humble ninja now,
I will make my exit in a puff of smoke.

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:32.290
Nin nin nin nin nin nin nin nin...

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.670
I found Nagomi.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.000
What?! Where?

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:43.960
Still in town, but a ninja now.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.750
A ninja? That's too funny!

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.380
She's still in Akiba?!

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:48.750
They'll kill her if they find out!

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:50.380
Why didn't you bring her back?

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:53.250
Because she was a ninja, not a maid.

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:55.040
What do we do, Chief?

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:56.710
She's still employed here, right?

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:58.710
She might come back, right?

00:06:58.710 --> 00:06:59.830
I mean, she's a ninja!

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:00.830
What does that mean?

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:02.040
How the heck should I know?!

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:08.710
Nagomi...

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:11.880
Be the maid you are now...

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:20.170
Then I'll have the assorted ninja rations.

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:22.420
Nagonin!

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:24.250
We have some lords asking for you specifically!

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:35.920
My lords! Thank you so much for choosing me.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:38.790
I'm the ninja known as Nagonin!

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:41.000
Is it really you, Nagomi?

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:42.130
Um...

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:43.540
Were you at Oinky Doink?

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:44.830
You must be mistaken...

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:47.080
We were all fans of Nerula!

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:50.500
The maid called Ranko at Oinky Doink
told us where you were!

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.710
That you're hiding in stealth here.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:53.920
No really, I'm not-

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:56.080
There's something we wanted to give you!

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:57.380
Here.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.580
<b>NERULA</b>

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.580
<b>Dream big, go go</b>

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.580
<b>A maid for life!</b>

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.040
Nerula...

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:03.710
Oh, we didn't mean to make you cry!

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.290
Sorry, we're sorry.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.630
So it really is you, Nagomi.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.710
Why are you crying, too?

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:13.830
Well, I've never had a favorite maid die before.

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:15.790
Hey, it's the same for me.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.920
I guess this is what it's like to have a favorite die.

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:22.330
Nerula was such a good maid, you know?

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:25.130
She had a good set of standards.

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:29.420
Remember that thing she'd say?
"Dream big..."

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:31.000
Dream big, go go.

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:33.790
Dream big...

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:35.040
...go go.

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:40.630
Think "Dream big, go go!" okay?

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:47.880
It's because of me that Nerula d-died...

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.540
I'm so sorry!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:50.880
I'm sorry. I'm sorry...

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.630
Please don't say that!

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:55.750
We didn't come here to accuse you or anything!

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:59.330
Nerula always talked about you, Nagomi.

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:02.250
She said you'd make a good maid.

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:07.540
Nagomi will change what it means
to be a maid in Akiba.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:08.790
I'm sure of it.

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:10.540
She said that?

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:13.500
Here, you should keep this.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.000
You!

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:46.210
You're not going back to the cafe?

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:50.210
Even if I did now, I'd just drag everybody down.

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:54.500
That kid, such a shame.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:57.880
What do you think I can do to repay Nerula?

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:02.380
I've been running that ramen joint for years in Akiba,

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:05.290
and the customers all love that the
taste's the same as always.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:09.630
But actually, I've changed the flavor
of my ramen quite a lot.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:13.830
Some thing's you gotta change
in order to stay the same.

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:16.500
I don't quite understand.

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.500
Wait, wasn't this someone's order?

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:20.710
Thanks, come again.

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:33.920
You have to change in order to stay the same...

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.080
Two, four, six...

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.290
There's a lot of them.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.040
Seventeen in all.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:49.540
Let's go alert the others.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.330
So they're coming at us head-on?

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.000
And they have more than double our numbers.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.040
We're done for.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.630
Are we dead for real?
But I just got my nails redone.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:59.250
And I have a fishing rod I've never used!

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:07.250
Right, time to hunt us some pigs!

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:08.250
Yeah!

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:08.670
<b>Oinky Doink Cafe</b>

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:14.670
No good, huh?

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:16.330
We've got maids watching the windows.

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:18.330
The swine have nowhere to run.

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:20.920
Ah, so this is the only entrance.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:28.040
Take that!

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:29.540
Don't mess with us!

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:31.750
You're not getting away!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.630
Get back here, punk!

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:40.710
Chief!

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:47.580
We can talk this out!
Let's put our guns down and talk!

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.580
Hey! We've got a hostage here!

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:56.670
Ya really think we'd give a damn 'bout some hostage?

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:00.670
Go up! Get th' top floors first!

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:01.670
Right!

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:21.710
They send back, like, a hundred
for every bullet we shoot!

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:22.710
You mean ten.

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:24.460
Who cares?!
We're gonna die!

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:29.210
That was from outside!

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:30.960
It might be some Creatureland backup.

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:32.170
You all go take a look!

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:33.170
Right!

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.130
There's no one here.

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:43.130
But if they send backup we'll be cornered.

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:44.330
Stay on the lookout!

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:45.330
Right!

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:50.880
All outta yer tricks eh, pigheads?!

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:52.210
Get out here!

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:55.000
Though I ain't gonna let ya die easy!

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.080
I'm sorry! They got past the third floor!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:58.540
They've got us trapped!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.960
Yumechi, I shall charge out on the offense.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.290
Use that chance to take out the enemy leader.

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:04.790
Huh? Are you kidding me?

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:06.170
They have too much firepower.

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:08.170
We don't have much ammunition left, either.

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:09.880
If you go out now, you'll die!

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:12.830
That's not a problem if I can protect this cafe!

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:14.040
Ranko...

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:18.250
Take this!

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:23.750
What the...

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.420
Who the hell are you?

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:39.920
A ninja?!

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:40.630
Is it a ninja?!
A ninja?!<b></b>

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:41.460
Is it a ninja?!
It's a ninja!<b></b>

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:42.670
Miss Manami, a ninja!

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:44.210
Wrong!

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:46.330
I am not a ninja!

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:47.670
I'm a maid!

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:51.040
This stops, right now!

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:56.170
Damn!

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:04.130
Ranko, I want to be a maid, after all!

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:05.330
I'm done with running!

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:06.630
We can talk later!

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:13.290
Why you...

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:14.500
What the damn hell?!

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:16.170
Die!

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:20.000
Take this!

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:29.170
Punk, I'll fuckin' kill you!

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:31.380
I won't let you kill anyone else!

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.830
I want to live, here in Akiba!

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:38.210
Yah!

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:39.920
There!

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:44.790
Look at them go.

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:46.000
We're going, too!

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.000
What?!

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:04.380
You shits!

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.580
Miss Manami!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:07.040
Leggo!

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:08.670
We can't back down here!

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:11.750
If you die, what's gonna happen to Maidalien?!

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:13.080
Leggo, damn it!

00:15:13.960 --> 00:15:15.750
Don't you run away from me!

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:17.330
All of you, go!

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:23.630
Nagomi, go!

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.330
You've got a score to settle, right?

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:28.960
You too, Ranko!

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:30.670
Please take care of things here.

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:31.880
Okay!

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:47.630
Those fuckers! I'm gon' kill 'em all!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:49.170
Let's call for backup.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:52.920
As long as we can get more numbers,
we can win this war!

00:15:54.170 --> 00:15:56.580
What did'ja just say, Ugaki?

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.790
The war's already begun.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:00.580
You can cut the tough talk.

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:03.380
You vermin can go ahead and squash each other.

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:05.750
We don't give a damn anymore.

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:07.920
We're going to be Creatures.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.540
What the hell does that mean?

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:13.630
Us extraterrestrials will join hands with
the Creatures to live on in Akiba.

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:14.920
It's a merger.

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:19.080
We've come to an understanding
beyond the stargate, if you will.

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:22.500
Manami, thanks for all you did for us.

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.790
I hope you at least die peacefully.

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:34.290
Ouch!

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:36.170
Sorry, Miss Manami.

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:38.460
Yer really so useless.

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:39.750
I'm sorry!

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:47.000
Forget it, jus' go.

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:48.960
But...

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:50.500
Beat it. Now.

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:25.460
Well, missy, here to settle th' score, eh?

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:27.920
I can't forgive you for what you did.

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:29.920
So what'cha gonna do?

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:32.170
You gon' kill me, hmm?

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:34.460
Bet ya can't, though.

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:36.920
You're no maid, missy.

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:38.580
I am a maid.

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:40.000
Yer a ninja.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:41.000
I'm a maid!

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:43.790
A maid who just stands 'round
like a useless piece of shit?!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.250
Ranko!

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:50.710
If we let her live, she'll just come attack us again.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:54.080
You've got that right.

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:57.210
It really is a shame.

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:01.000
Nagomi, please get out of the way.

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:02.000
I won't.

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:04.290
Think yer protecting me now?

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:06.250
What a fucking insult.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:07.250
Move!

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:11.000
My bat against yer gun and we're even.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.750
Go on and pitch me a live 'un.

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:15.080
You want to fight that badly?

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:17.380
A maid has gotta fight!

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:19.040
That's not what a maid is about!

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:21.170
Whaddaya mean?!

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:24.710
A maid goes fer a glorious death over livin' in disgrace!

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:27.880
If you die, your masters will be sad, won't they?!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:31.000
Ramen changes over time and so should maids!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.750
What the hell does that mean, freak?

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:36.580
Yer sister must be crying down in Hell.

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:39.920
Nerula said I should stay just the way I am.

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:42.630
So there's no point in killing the likes of you.

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:43.880
Fucking wuss!

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:46.250
Ya jus' don't have what it takes t' fight to the death!

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:47.830
I won't ever forgive you.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:49.710
But I won't kill you.

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:51.790
That's the kind of maid I'm going to be!

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:56.580
Bright-eyed youthful opinion time is over!

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:03.630
Live! Don't kill!

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:07.040
If you call yourself a maid, feel the moe moe kyun!

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.830
Yer a ninja, ain'tcha?

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:11.960
Why'd I hafta hear that shit from a fucking ninja, eh?!

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.540
I'm a maid!

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.630
Moe! Moe! Kyun!

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:33.000
Yer such a pain.

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.960
Pig huntin's over.

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:38.130
Time to get back t' space.

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:54.170
I'm going to be my own idea of a maid
that Nerula would be proud of.

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:57.880
Welcome home, Nagomi.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:01.460
I'm back, oink.

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:06.170
<b>Maidalien</b>

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:12.130
Reeks of creatures in 'ere.

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:15.080
Ugaki, I can see the collar 'round yer neck.

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:18.330
You'd best not underestimate me anymore.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:22.540
Look at you, all big and mighty with yer gun,
but still tremblin'.

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:24.790
I can't let you make a fool out of me anymore!

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:28.540
Don't ya start sounding like a maid now.

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:32.920
It's time for you to become a stardust memory.

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:50.170
Damn that hurts...

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.920
It sure hurts to live.

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:06.000
<b>Creatureland</b>

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:05.960
I see.

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:09.290
A job well done, Ms. Ugaki.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:13.880
<b>Is the maid</b>

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:13.880
<b>turf war over?!</b>

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:16.290
<b>Is the maid</b>

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:16.290
<b>turf war over?!</b>

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:16.290
<b>A Merger Between Creatureland and Maidalien?</b>

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:18.330
And so, Manami's plan to
take over Maidalien headquarters

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:16.630
<b>Is the maid</b>

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:16.630
<b>turf war over?!</b>

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:19.040
<b>Is the maid</b>

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:19.040
<b>turf war over?!</b>

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:19.040
<b>Possible Internal Rift Within Maidalien</b>

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:22.170
and wage war on the Creatureland Group
ended in failure.

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:27.210
A faction of the Maidalien Group that
opposed the merger broke away,

00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:31.250
and the second-generation head, Ugaki,
once again returned to power.

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:34.420
However, having lost their war hawks,

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:38.790
Maidalien had no choice but to agree
to all of Creatureland's demands,

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:42.080
dashing Ugaki's hopes for a merger on equal terms.

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:47.420
Consequently, Creatureland swallowed
Maidalien whole in the merger,

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:50.500
and the Maidalien Group effectively disappeared.

00:21:51.630 --> 00:21:56.710
No one knows what became of Manami,
the maid called the Crimson Supernova.

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:04.210
Thus, Akihabara entered an era
of Creatureland Group domination.

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:07.210
<b>Individual Creatureland Group</b>

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:07.210
<b>Cafe Performance Report</b>

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:07.210
<b>Oinky Doink Cafe</b>

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:08.630
They were better off roasted whole.

00:22:24.670 --> 00:22:29.580
Another day, another chance to go moe moe kyun

00:22:30.880 --> 00:22:36.000
I come to the pigsty for my moe moe kyun

00:22:36.880 --> 00:22:42.000
That's the sort of life I lead

00:22:43.210 --> 00:22:51.790
Mock me, and you just might bleed

00:22:51.790 --> 00:22:57.380
Is the hesitation that wells up

00:22:57.920 --> 00:23:06.210
The lingering scent of a humane soul?

00:23:06.830 --> 00:23:13.290
Whether you get to live or die

00:23:13.540 --> 00:23:19.130
Tread your own path

00:23:19.130 --> 00:23:25.500
Have the guts to pull that trigger

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:31.830
Who are you

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:38.750
Show me through the pain
